+// Zandatsu (renut/0047, de Dragon Burst 0107): a draw that neither tests nor writes depth nor uses stencil opens its
+// pass without the depth target (GPUs by tiles then neither load nor store it), unless the open pass already has it
+// with the same colours.
+REXCVAR_DEFINE_BOOL(swordman_renut_depth_drop, true, "SwordMan",
+                    "Renut: os passes sem teste nem escrita de profundidade nem stencil abrem so com a cor (a Mali e o "
+                    "Adreno em GMEM nao leem nem gravam a profundidade); false = como antes");
